<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results on the eighth</p>
<p>day of</p>
<p>the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 6-7 (4-7)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 4-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-7 (7-9) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2 3-2 (retired)</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat 11-Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-2 3-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Women's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat 15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland)</p>
<p>4-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6) 6-1</p>
</text>
